{"unit_id":"Eddyxyc__dsh-rea-switch#card-zh","repo":"Eddyxyc/dsh-rea-switch","commit":"68fb7ca00f7b1089f08c4a870c808d11558a14aa","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rea-switch 是一个 DSH Web 插件，在 Plugins 页面增加 REA 开关标签。它通过插件管理接口读取 rea-mcp 与 rea-compact 的启用状态，并可关闭两套工具或在完整版和压缩版之间切换，切换时先停用当前版本再启用目标版本。页面显示运行状态、冲突提示、错误和重启提示，也会记住上次选择的版本。适合需要管理 REA MCP 工具集、或需要压缩工具描述以适配网关限制的 DSH 用户。使用前需在 profile 配置中同时声明两行 REA 插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:525-550","client.js:297-382"]}
{"unit_id":"Eddyxyc__dsh-rea-switch#card-en","repo":"Eddyxyc/dsh-rea-switch","commit":"68fb7ca00f7b1089f08c4a870c808d11558a14aa","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rea-switch adds a REA tab to DSH Web. It reads the full and compact plugin states, turns both off, or switches variants by disabling one before enabling the other. The tab shows status and conflicts, reports errors, and remembers the last choice. Both REA rows must be declared in the profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:525-550","client.js:297-382"]}
